  "instructions": [
    {
      "id": 414665,
      "primary_message": "Place miso paste, vinegar, honey, and spices in a large bowl. Stir to combine the marinade.",
      "secondary_message": "⅓ cup miso paste, red\n2 tbsp rice vinegar\n2 tbsp honey\n1 ½ tsp crushed red pepper\n1 ½ tsp garlic powder\n¾ tsp salt"
    },
    {
      "id": 414666,
      "primary_message": "Pat chicken dry with paper towels. Holding a knife parallel to the cutting board, cut the chicken in half horizontally to form thin fillets. Add to the bowl with the marinade and turn to coat. Set aside. ",
      "secondary_message": "1.02 kg chicken breasts, boneless skinless"
    },
    {
      "id": 414667,
      "primary_message": "Wash and dry chives. Using a clean cutting board, chop chives into small pieces. Place in another large bowl, along with the dressing, and stir to combine. Set aside. ",
      "secondary_message": "1 small pkg chives\n¾ cup honey mustard dressing"
    },
    {
      "id": 414668,
      "primary_message": "Preheat a large skillet over medium-high heat. ",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "id": 414669,
      "primary_message": "Once the skillet is hot, add oil and swirl to coat the bottom. Working in batches if necessary, add chicken and pan-fry until golden and cooked through, 3-4 minutes per side. Remove from heat. ",
      "secondary_message": "2 tbsp toasted sesame oil"
    },
    {
      "id": 414670,
      "primary_message": "Meanwhile, wash, dry, peel, and slice mango flesh away from the pits, starting with the flat sides; medium dice. Add to the bowl with the dressing, along with the broccoli slaw, and toss to combine. ",
      "secondary_message": "3 mangoes\n1 ½ (340 g) pkgs broccoli slaw"
    },
    {
      "id": 414671,
      "primary_message": "To serve, divide chicken and slaw between plates. Enjoy!",
      "secondary_message": null
    }
  ],
